# Ruin-Lurker Bat: "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn, scry 1." Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Bat (Mox Pearl), then Faithless Looting
# (a Mountain, with Mox Ruby and Mox Jet's mana) draws two Plains and discards an Ornithopter and a Plains: permanent cards put into Bot1's graveyard,
# so it descended (CR 700.11). At its end step the Bat's trigger scries exactly one card (CR 701.22): the top card, an Island,
# goes to the bottom, so the turn 3 draw is the Swamp under it (the scry is one card). The Bat is a 1/1 flying lifelink creature.

